                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Please find Titanium Industries Aluminum cross reference metal equivalency chart below. There are many Aluminum alloys and designation standards that are used depending on countries, engineering practices, and many other standards. A description of each material standard can also be found underneath the Aluminum equivalency chart."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "For questions or inquiries please contact us today: [[email protected]](https://titanium.com/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#1261737e776152667b66737c7b677f3c717d7f)"
                },
